# Test of the Champion (Q223), a second class-change test for warriors, played by a level 39
# Warrior who already holds most of each trophy count (the kills below bring each to its count),
# every script roll pinned to 1 (no harpy or road scavenger calls its kin, every drop lands):
# Ascalon starts it and pays the level 39 set's Dimensional Diamonds (72 for a Warrior); Mason
# wants a hundred Bloody Axe heads for his letter; Groot wants thirty harpy eggs, medusa venoms
# and windsus biles for his letter; Mouen wants a hundred road ratman heads, then a hundred Leto
# lizardman fangs, for his letter; Ascalon gives the Mark of Champion; then relog. Expectations
# replay the reference trace of this scenario.
trace internal/gameserver/script/testdata/oracle/scenarios/q223_test_of_the_champion.golden
character Champion 39
class 1
random always 1
hold 3290 97
hold 3287 27
hold 3288 28
hold 3289 28
hold 3291 97
hold 3292 94
script quest.Q223_TestOfTheChampion
item 3276 3277 3278 3279 3280 3281 3282 3283 3284 3285 3286 3287 3288 3289 3290 3291 3292 7562
page default/30624.htm
page default/30625.htm
page merchant/30093.htm
page guard/30196.htm
page script/quest/Q223_TestOfTheChampion/
npc ascalon 30624 Folk 10 0 0
npc mason 30625 Folk -10 0 0
